'''Indore Management Association''' ('''IMA'''), an association of entrepreneurs and professional managers was formed in 1963. The association was registered in July 1990 under the provision of M.P. Non – Trading Corporation Act. 1962. IMA is affiliated to [[All India Management Association]] (AIMA) as one of its constituent bodies.<ref>{{Cite web |title=Indore Management Association |url=https://www.imaindore.com/aboutus.php |access-date=2025-02-24 |website=imaindore.com}}</ref> It has direct and indirect membership of over 3500 members including corporates, entrepreneurs, professionals, businessmen, academics and students.<ref>{{Cite web |last=International |first=EnKing |date=2021-05-24 |title=Indore Management Association – EKI Energy Services Limited |url=https://enkingint.org/project/ima/ |access-date=2025-02-24 |language=en-US}}</ref>

